# Ignore everything by default. This directory is a training handoff folded into
# the recipe repo. Track the docs and small text artifacts; keep the large
# data/metadata binaries out of the code repo's git history (they remain on disk
# and in the original standalone handoff repo).
*

# Keep repository docs and small text artifacts only.
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/COMMANDS.sh
!/RECIPE.sh
!/CHANGES.md
!/LOG_evo2_7b_8k.md
!/LOG_evo2_20b.md
!/LOG_evo2_40b.md
!/LOG_evo2_longer_3000steps.md
!/LOG_evo2_context_ablation.md
!/LOG_B300_blackwell.md

!/savanna/
!/savanna/preprocess_commands.sh
!/savanna/data_config_viral_lora.json

# Intentionally NOT tracked here (large binaries; available on disk / handoff repo):
#   data/train.jsonl.gz, data/valid.jsonl.gz, metadata/eukaryotic_host_core_manifest.tsv.gz

# Consolidated results doc + uncapped length-stratified scoring + its scripts
!/RESULTS_SUMMARY.md
!/EXPLORATION_LOG.md
!/RESULTS_uncapped_bylen.txt
!/analysis/
